# Type Conversion: Explicit vs Implicit 🔄

## 1. Explicit Conversion (Safe & Clear):
```javascript
// String to Number
let num = Number("42");       // 42
let parsed = parseInt("42px");// 42

// Number to String
let str = String(100);        // "100"
let str2 = (100).toString();  // "100"

// To Boolean
let bool = Boolean(1);        // true
let bool2 = Boolean(0);       // false
```

## 2. Implicit Coercion (Unexpected traps):
```javascript
console.log("5" + 2); // "52" (String concatenation!)
console.log("5" - 2); // 3    (Implicit conversion to number!)
```

