# Built-in Math Object 🧮

Perform mathematical calculations with the standard `Math` library:

```javascript
console.log(Math.PI);             // 3.141592653589793
console.log(Math.round(4.7));     // 5 (Rounds to nearest integer)
console.log(Math.floor(4.9));     // 4 (Rounds down)
console.log(Math.ceil(4.1));      // 5 (Rounds up)
console.log(Math.max(10, 20, 5)); // 20
console.log(Math.min(10, 20, 5)); // 5
console.log(Math.random());       // Random float between 0 and 1
```

